<p>
  Hi <%= @user.first_name %>.
</p>

<p>
  We're writing to let you know that a security setting on your Fuime account was changed:
</p>

<p>
  <b><%= @change %></b>
</p>

<p>
  If you made this change, no further action is needed.
</p>

<p>
  If this is unexpected, please review
  <%= link_to "your Fuime account's security settings", settings_security_url %>
  and contact us at
  <%= mail_to "support@fuime.com" %>.
</p>

<p>
  Thanks,<br>
  The Fuime Team
</p>
